36
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">dakara haruka kanata</font></b></font></font></font>

37
00:01:13,850 --> 00:01:20,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="22"><font face="Hira v8"><b><font color="#030103">and so we'll go far off into the distance</font></b></font></font></font>

38
00:01:34,360 --> 00:01:36,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've... had it...</font>

39
00:01:36,780 --> 00:01:38,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, Sakura-chan!</font>

40
00:01:39,370 --> 00:01:41,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">For crying out loud,
how far have we walked?</font>

41
00:01:41,830 --> 00:01:44,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The tower hasn't gotten a bit closer.</font>

42
00:01:45,500 --> 00:01:47,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here we can see it
right in front of our eyes.</font>

43
00:01:47,920 --> 00:01:49,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Strange...</font>

44
00:01:50,000 --> 00:01:51,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake about it.</font>

45
00:01:51,170 --> 00:01:55,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It seems that we're already within
the enthusiastic welcome.</font>

46
00:01:57,300 --> 00:01:58,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Take a look at that.</font>

47
00:01:59,090 --> 00:01:59,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh?</font>

48
00:02:00,470 --> 00:02:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, that can't be!</font>

49
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What on earth is going on?!</font>

50
00:02:09,150 --> 00:02:10,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way!</font>

51
00:02:10,520 --> 00:02:11,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is it Genjutsu...?</font>

52
00:02:12,070 --> 00:02:15,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So it seems.
We were lured in perfectly.</font>

53
00:02:16,530 --> 00:02:19,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears we were meticulously careful,</font>

54
00:02:19,660 --> 00:02:22,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and were made to walk
around the same place in a circle.</font>

55
00:02:23,700 --> 00:02:25,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're being watched...</font>

56
00:02:25,660 --> 00:02:26,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably.</font>

57
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:29,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They intend to wear down
our physical strength and</font>

58
00:02:29,210 --> 00:02:31,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">catch us unprepared when
we're bone-tired.</font>

59
00:02:31,920 --> 00:02:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If so, then this follows the enemy strategy.</font>

60
00:02:35,170 --> 00:02:38,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... They'll be coming soon.</font>

61
00:03:16,800 --> 00:03:18,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Humph, they've appeared.</font>

62
00:03:19,630 --> 00:03:21,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the perfect handicap.</font>

63
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:28,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Replication</font>

64
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:28,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Match!</font>

65
00:03:22,220 --> 00:03:28,270
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">I'm the Main Character!</font>

66
00:03:34,060 --> 00:03:35,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What is this?</font>

67
00:03:36,770 --> 00:03:38,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's quite a number.</font>

68
00:03:39,030 --> 00:03:40,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Moreover, they're clones?</font>

69
00:03:42,950 --> 00:03:44,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cornered rats.</font>

70
00:03:47,790 --> 00:03:50,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up!</font>

71
00:03:57,130 --> 00:04:00,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, they're quite weak, huh?</font>

72
00:04:01,470 --> 00:04:02,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good!</font>

73
00:04:02,510 --> 00:04:03,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

74
00:04:21,440 --> 00:04:23,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What are these guys?</font>

75
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:37,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on here?</font>

76
00:04:44,300 --> 00:04:45,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll assess this!</font>

77
00:04:46,260 --> 00:04:47,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

78
00:04:53,350 --> 00:04:54,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

79
00:05:10,370 --> 00:05:11,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke!</font>

80
00:05:21,050 --> 00:05:22,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

81
00:05:28,390 --> 00:05:30,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What's going on?</font>

82
00:05:30,680 --> 00:05:31,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My body's...</font>

83
00:05:36,270 --> 00:05:37,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are you okay?</font>

84
00:05:42,360 --> 00:05:43,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No mistake.</font>

85
00:05:43,570 --> 00:05:45,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's the real thing, not an illusion.</font>

86
00:05:46,150 --> 00:05:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Scroll please.
— Scroll please.</font>

87
00:05:54,120 --> 00:05:58,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That Kabuto-san was injured means
these things are actual Shadow Clones?!</font>

88
00:06:00,210 --> 00:06:03,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But... even though Shadow clones
are supposed to vanish</font>

89
00:06:03,630 --> 00:06:07,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if they take a direct attack,
these things don't vanish.</font>

90
00:06:07,300 --> 00:06:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Does it mean then this is Genjutsu?!</font>

91
00:06:08,470 --> 00:06:09,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Which is it?!</font>

92
00:06:10,260 --> 00:06:12,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scroll please.</font>

93
00:06:12,390 --> 00:06:14,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Scroll please.</font>

94
00:06:14,850 --> 00:06:16,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Give me scroll.</font>

95
00:06:17,560 --> 00:06:18,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

96
00:06:18,730 --> 00:06:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's futile!</font>

97
00:06:19,900 --> 00:06:20,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

98
00:06:24,730 --> 00:06:26,240
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These things are illusions.</font>

99
00:06:26,900 --> 00:06:28,530
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's an enemy Genjutsu.</font>

100
00:06:30,360 --> 00:06:34,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But, Kabuto-san's wound is the real thing.</font>

101
00:06:35,160 --> 00:06:37,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's as Sasuke-kun says.</font>

102
00:06:38,620 --> 00:06:41,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Probably the enemy is hiding somewhere...</font>

103
00:06:41,790 --> 00:06:44,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and coordinating their attack with
movements of the "Genjutsu Shinobi"</font>

104
00:06:44,460 --> 00:06:46,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attacking from a different location.</font>

105
00:06:47,300 --> 00:06:51,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pretending as if those
Genjutsu Shinobi are attacking.</font>

106
00:06:52,220 --> 00:06:56,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">— Scroll please.
— Scroll please.</font>

107
00:07:01,270 --> 00:07:04,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then I'll find the idiot who's behind
the scenes</font>

108
00:07:04,360 --> 00:07:06,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">throwing Kunai knives
and kick his butt!</font>

109
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:08,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hold it, Naruto-kun.</font>

110
00:07:08,950 --> 00:07:12,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We've been deceived as
to the source of the Kunai knives...</font>

111
00:07:12,370 --> 00:07:14,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so we can't discover the precise
location of the enemy like this.</font>

112
00:07:14,990 --> 00:07:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Do you get it?</font>

113
00:07:16,410 --> 00:07:18,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is the enemy's purpose.</font>

114
00:07:19,660 --> 00:07:23,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From a data standpoint, it's a type
who is weak at close combat</font>

115
00:07:23,170 --> 00:07:25,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and Taijutsu that likes
this kind of attack.</font>

116
00:07:26,500 --> 00:07:31,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The true enemy won't come out until we can't move at all.</font>

117
00:07:35,760 --> 00:07:37,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Listen, everyone!</font>

118
00:07:37,260 --> 00:07:38,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In any case,</font>

119
00:07:38,520 --> 00:07:40,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">all there is to do now is to fend
off the enemy attack.</font>

120
00:07:44,230 --> 00:07:47,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fine, if that's what their plan is...</font>

121
00:07:48,780 --> 00:07:51,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now then...
I wonder how far they can hold out.</font>

122
00:07:52,990 --> 00:07:54,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The night is long.</font>

123
00:08:14,510 --> 00:08:16,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man!
This is endless!</font>

124
00:08:18,350 --> 00:08:19,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since it's come to this...!</font>

125
00:08:20,100 --> 00:08:20,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop!</font>

126
00:08:21,100 --> 00:08:23,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun, don't waste your Chakra!</font>

127
00:08:24,230 --> 00:08:26,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you attack these things,
there's no point!</font>

128
00:08:27,900 --> 00:08:30,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I hit them all in
a single sweep,</font>

129
00:08:30,570 --> 00:08:34,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the enemy won't fire inadvertently
while these things are reverting back.</font>

130
00:08:34,780 --> 00:08:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The hiding place will
be discovered, so.</font>

131
00:08:37,700 --> 00:08:39,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clone Jutsu!</font>

132
00:08:45,290 --> 00:08:46,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Clones?!</font>

133
00:09:07,690 --> 00:09:09,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not over yet!</font>

134
00:09:10,070 --> 00:09:11,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun, what should we do...?</font>

135
00:09:12,570 --> 00:09:16,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, that useless...
All there is to do is go for it!</font>

136
00:09:16,410 --> 00:09:17,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">B-But...</font>

137
00:09:17,780 --> 00:09:18,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Indeed...</font>

138
00:09:18,700 --> 00:09:21,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not a situation that
he can get through by himself.</font>

139
00:09:22,330 --> 00:09:23,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's go, Sakura!</font>

140
00:09:23,500 --> 00:09:24,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah!</font>

141
00:09:50,400 --> 00:09:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm not finished yet...</font>

142
00:09:59,910 --> 00:10:01,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Dawn is breaking.</font>

143
00:10:02,080 --> 00:10:03,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's finally time for the hunt.</font>

144
00:10:04,450 --> 00:10:06,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mubi, that's enough.</font>

145
00:10:07,830 --> 00:10:10,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're finished hunting their spirits.</font>

146
00:10:11,040 --> 00:10:13,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now what's left is just their bodies.</font>

147
00:10:15,590 --> 00:10:16,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky.</font>

148
00:10:19,930 --> 00:10:24,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're... the one who...
did my left shoulder.</font>

149
00:10:25,430 --> 00:10:27,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I finally found you.</font>

150
00:10:28,270 --> 00:10:30,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really hung me up.</font>

151
00:10:30,900 --> 00:10:31,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky.</font>

152
00:10:32,230 --> 00:10:34,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can finally even the score.</font>

153
00:10:44,160 --> 00:10:47,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You... really hung me up.</font>

154
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky.</font>

155
00:10:49,960 --> 00:10:52,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can finally even the score.</font>

156
00:11:00,800 --> 00:11:01,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh!</font>

157
00:11:03,800 --> 00:11:05,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Cornered rats.</font>

158
00:11:08,890 --> 00:11:10,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It went well, Naruto!</font>

159
00:11:21,950 --> 00:11:24,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">W-What the hell
are these guys?!</font>

160
00:11:25,580 --> 00:11:26,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This can't be!</font>

161
00:11:26,950 --> 00:11:28,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since when...?!</font>

162
00:11:28,500 --> 00:11:29,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Idiot!</font>

163
00:11:29,830 --> 00:11:32,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You finally showed your
true colors, punk!</font>

164
00:11:38,710 --> 00:11:42,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">T-This brat, don't tell me...</font>

165
00:11:43,180 --> 00:11:45,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Shadow Clone is just
the preparation for the trick...</font>

166
00:11:48,020 --> 00:11:51,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">for me to portray every member
of the team by myself!</font>

167
00:11:53,560 --> 00:11:56,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At the same time Naruto
lifted the Shadow Clone,</font>

168
00:11:56,360 --> 00:11:59,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the three of us hid.</font>

169
00:12:00,740 --> 00:12:04,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Genjutsu users were
adversely deceived.</font>

170
00:12:11,290 --> 00:12:12,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

171
00:12:13,620 --> 00:12:17,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto, you've used too much Chakra.</font>

172
00:12:17,460 --> 00:12:19,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll do the rest.</font>

173
00:12:30,390 --> 00:12:34,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No way! I'm not always going to have
the good parts taken away!</font>

174
00:12:43,900 --> 00:12:47,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is this really that Naruto...?</font>

175
00:12:49,700 --> 00:12:53,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Since when had he improved
this much?</font>

176
00:12:55,370 --> 00:12:57,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's some brat...</font>

177
00:12:57,460 --> 00:12:59,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't believe he can still move.</font>

178
00:13:00,460 --> 00:13:01,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto...</font>

179
00:13:04,260 --> 00:13:06,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Amazing Chakra stamina...</font>

180
00:13:11,850 --> 00:13:13,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Right after
a Multiple Shadow Clone Jutsu...</font>

181
00:13:13,600 --> 00:13:17,150
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">a daring technique that transforms just
three of the bodies into his companions.</font>

182
00:13:17,560 --> 00:13:21,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To think he can still move
even after doing all that.</font>

183
00:13:21,860 --> 00:13:23,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it's the fifth day now.</font>

184
00:13:26,570 --> 00:13:27,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This kid will transform</font>

185
00:13:27,820 --> 00:13:32,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">if he can just master
the use of his Chakra.</font>

186
00:13:33,250 --> 00:13:35,080
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Not bad.</font>

187
00:13:35,660 --> 00:13:40,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But we're still not unlucky.</font>

188
00:13:43,210 --> 00:13:44,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no time.</font>

189
00:13:46,430 --> 00:13:49,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This time around,
we'll show you our Ninjutsu!</font>

190
00:13:50,470 --> 00:13:53,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Ninja Art: Fog Clone Jutsu!</font>

191
00:13:59,440 --> 00:14:00,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow clones?</font>

192
00:14:01,400 --> 00:14:02,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, they are plain clones.</font>

193
00:14:03,190 --> 00:14:05,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">However, he's up to something.</font>

194
00:14:05,570 --> 00:14:06,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be careful!</font>

195
00:14:06,700 --> 00:14:10,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hah! If they are just clones,
then there's one real body.</font>

196
00:14:10,820 --> 00:14:14,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'll kick their butts right
and left until I run into him.</font>

197
00:14:14,160 --> 00:14:15,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You idiot.</font>

198
00:14:15,200 --> 00:14:16,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Such a tactless thing...</font>

199
00:14:17,210 --> 00:14:18,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm telling you!</font>

200
00:14:18,330 --> 00:14:20,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm saying don't stick your nose in!</font>

201
00:14:24,710 --> 00:14:25,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

202
00:14:25,840 --> 00:14:26,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's reckless!</font>

203
00:14:27,550 --> 00:14:28,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez!</font>

204
00:14:36,310 --> 00:14:40,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From earlier, the nape of my neck
hurts when I use the Sharingan.</font>

205
00:14:40,850 --> 00:14:42,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Maybe I used too much Chakra.</font>

206
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

207
00:14:46,490 --> 00:14:47,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it. A clone?!</font>

208
00:14:49,660 --> 00:14:50,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one, too?!</font>

209
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:51,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one, too?!</font>

210
00:14:53,030 --> 00:14:53,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This one, too?!</font>

211
00:14:54,490 --> 00:14:56,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto-kun! Stop!</font>

212
00:14:56,330 --> 00:14:57,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Are they all fakes?!</font>

213
00:14:58,080 --> 00:15:00,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Or could it be Genjutsu again?!</font>

214
00:15:00,870 --> 00:15:04,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is... the last... Chakra.</font>

215
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:08,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sharingan!</font>

216
00:15:18,890 --> 00:15:19,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke-kun!</font>

217
00:15:22,480 --> 00:15:23,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The bruise again...</font>

218
00:15:26,730 --> 00:15:29,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop using the Sharingan, Sasuke-kun!</font>

219
00:15:31,820 --> 00:15:33,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't do to create an opening!</font>

220
00:15:44,170 --> 00:15:45,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto-san!</font>

221
00:15:50,470 --> 00:15:51,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn it!</font>

222
00:15:51,630 --> 00:15:52,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop! Naruto!</font>

223
00:15:54,390 --> 00:15:56,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No matter how much
you swing at them,</font>

224
00:15:56,720 --> 00:16:01,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">the real body isn't in those clones.</font>

225
00:16:02,190 --> 00:16:04,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then where's the enemy
attacking us from?!</font>

226
00:16:05,110 --> 00:16:09,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If they are merely clones,
the clones themselves can't attack!</font>

227
00:16:09,820 --> 00:16:11,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If I knew that, we wouldn't be
having a rough time of it!</font>

228
00:16:12,360 --> 00:16:13,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is the enemy's scheme.</font>

229
00:16:15,620 --> 00:16:18,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man, I can't use
the Shadow Clone Jutsu anymore...</font>

230
00:16:19,450 --> 00:16:21,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They've about reached their limit.</font>

231
00:16:22,040 --> 00:16:23,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Lucky.</font>

232
00:16:34,300 --> 00:16:35,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's it!</font>

233
00:16:35,550 --> 00:16:37,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The real body hides with
the Earth Style Jutsu</font>

234
00:16:37,260 --> 00:16:39,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and attacks from behind a clone!</font>

235
00:16:43,060 --> 00:16:44,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kabuto-san!</font>

236
00:17:19,640 --> 00:17:23,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Heh, "it won't do to
create an opening," right?!</font>

237
00:17:23,560 --> 00:17:28,020
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thank you, Naruto-kun.
You saved me.</font>

238
00:17:31,400 --> 00:17:33,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're okay here, Naruto!</font>

239
00:17:43,950 --> 00:17:46,710
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What happened there? Are you hurt?</font>

240
00:17:47,290 --> 00:17:48,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's a terrible bruise.</font>

241
00:17:50,540 --> 00:17:51,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's nothing.</font>

242
00:17:55,590 --> 00:17:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Here it is, here it is!</font>

243
00:17:58,550 --> 00:18:01,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Look, the Heaven scroll!</font>

244
00:18:01,220 --> 00:18:02,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good for you.</font>

245
00:18:04,980 --> 00:18:08,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's something about this guy...
that I don't like.</font>

246
00:18:20,280 --> 00:18:22,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh, it's you guys.</font>

247
00:18:23,290 --> 00:18:24,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're late, Kabuto.</font>

248
00:18:25,290 --> 00:18:27,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got a bit involved in something.</font>

249
00:18:28,080 --> 00:18:28,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sorry.</font>

250
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:34,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But, but...
thanks to you, we got both the scrolls.</font>

251
00:18:34,210 --> 00:18:37,130
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">No, it's because you guys fought hard.</font>

252
00:18:38,010 --> 00:18:40,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You were amazing
at the end, Naruto-kun.</font>

253
00:18:44,850 --> 00:18:47,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We're going through this door.</font>

254
00:18:48,310 --> 00:18:50,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Well then, I wish us both luck.</font>

255
00:18:50,560 --> 00:18:51,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

256
00:18:51,610 --> 00:18:52,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

257
00:19:03,910 --> 00:19:05,160
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What of the harvest?</font>

258
00:19:05,200 --> 00:19:06,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yes.</font>

259
00:19:06,450 --> 00:19:07,870
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">More than I expected.</font>

260
00:19:08,410 --> 00:19:13,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I filled in his entire data
from this second exam.</font>

261
00:19:13,880 --> 00:19:15,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You need this, right?</font>

262
00:19:16,510 --> 00:19:19,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">So, how was it?</font>

263
00:19:20,930 --> 00:19:22,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sure enough, it appears you're curious.</font>

264
00:19:23,050 --> 00:19:24,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Orochimaru-sama.</font>

265
00:19:25,430 --> 00:19:27,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I want to ask your opinion.</font>

266
00:19:28,180 --> 00:19:30,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As a Sound Village's spy...</font>

267
00:19:31,190 --> 00:19:33,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's not necessary, is it?</font>

268
00:19:33,900 --> 00:19:37,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will be the one to decide it all, so...</font>

269
00:19:39,860 --> 00:19:44,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I like that cleverness of yours.</font>

270
00:19:46,280 --> 00:19:47,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Good work.</font>

271
00:19:49,250 --> 00:19:51,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's nobody here.</font>

272
00:19:52,580 --> 00:19:54,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm okay now, Sakura.</font>

273
00:19:54,960 --> 00:19:56,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">O-Okay.</font>

274
00:19:56,920 --> 00:19:58,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's too bad!</font>

275
00:19:59,010 --> 00:20:00,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shannaro!</font>

276
00:20:00,630 --> 00:20:04,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, hey, what're we supposed to do?</font>

277
00:20:04,550 --> 00:20:06,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! Look at that...</font>

278
00:20:06,810 --> 00:20:12,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Without... Heaven...
I don't get it at all.</font>

279
00:20:12,190 --> 00:20:13,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If "Heaven" does not exist,</font>

280
00:20:13,270 --> 00:20:14,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">enrich your knowledge,
and prepare for the chance.</font>

281
00:20:15,060 --> 00:20:15,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">If "Earth" does not exist,</font>

282
00:20:15,980 --> 00:20:17,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">run the fields in search
of an advantage.</font>

283
00:20:18,020 --> 00:20:19,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Open the series of
Heaven and Earth,</font>

284
00:20:19,860 --> 00:20:21,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the perilous way
shall be redressed...</font>

285
00:20:21,950 --> 00:20:26,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is namely the secret of
"the one that guides..."</font>

286
00:20:27,200 --> 00:20:28,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's that?</font>

287
00:20:29,950 --> 00:20:33,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like there are letters
or something missing there.</font>

288
00:20:33,750 --> 00:20:36,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's probably has to do with the scroll.</font>

289
00:20:36,710 --> 00:20:41,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I think this means we're supposed
to open the Heaven & Earth scroll.</font>

290
00:21:00,980 --> 00:21:03,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay then, I'm going to open it.</font>

291
00:21:05,330 --> 00:21:10,250
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">hey, can you hear it?</font></b></font></font>

292
00:21:05,330 --> 00:21:10,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<b><font face="Gandhi Sans">nee kikoe masu ka</font></b></font>

293
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">sora wa hate shinaku aoku sunde ite</font></b></font></font></font>

294
00:21:10,350 --> 00:21:19,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the clear, blue sky goes on and on</font></b></font></font></font>

295
00:21:19,060 --> 00:21:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">umi wa kagiri naku koudai de ite</font></b></font></font>

296
00:21:19,060 --> 00:21:28,310
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">the ocean spans limitlessly</font></b></font></font></font>

297
00:21:28,310 --> 00:21:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">kimi wa itsumade mo egao de ite</font></b></font></font>

298
00:21:28,310 --> 00:21:37,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font size="25"><font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">please keep that smile on your face forever</font></b></font></font></font>

299
00:21:37,380 --> 00:21:43,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font color="#ebbfb9"><b><font face="Gandhi Sans">janai to nai chau kara</font></b></font></font>

